# The measurement image needs four files from the repository and nothing else:
# the declared Python dependencies, the locked crate graph (so the campaign can
# run with the network off), and the two scripts that go into /usr/local/bin. The
# repository itself is bind-mounted at run time, so shipping it into the image
# would only make the image stale.
#
# `*` excludes top-level entries, `*/**` excludes everything below them, and the
# four exceptions are named back in. The builder still descends into a directory
# it has excluded when an exception could match inside it, which is what makes
# this work. Do not add `!*/`: the pattern is cleaned to `!*` and re-includes
# every top-level file, which put the 18 MB slide deck and the built PDFs into
# the context.
*
*/**
!bench/requirements.txt
!rust/Cargo.toml
!rust/Cargo.lock
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!docker/preflight.sh
